    "details": "<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<p>Put your AI knowledge to the test! Claude Build Challenge 2026 is a fast-paced online quiz designed for students, developers, and tech enthusiasts to showcase their understanding of Claude AI, generative AI fundamentals, and prompt engineering.</p>\n<p><strong>About the Quiz</strong></p>\n<p>This challenge is a straightforward, knowledge-based competition focused on speed and accuracy. Whether you are just getting started with AI or actively exploring large language models, this quiz is a great way to benchmark your skills and earn recognition.</p>\n<p><strong>Quiz Format &amp; Details</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Mode: Online (hosted on Unstop)</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Participation: Individual (Solo)</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Format: Multiple Choice Questions (MCQs)</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Eligibility: Open to all undergraduate/postgraduate students and tech enthusiasts.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rules &amp; Guidelines</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>All participants must complete the quiz within the given time window.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Each question carries equal weightage, with no negative marking (update if applicable).</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Tie-Breaker: In case of a tie in scores, the participant who finishes in less time will be ranked higher.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Participants can only attempt the quiz once; multiple entries will lead to disqualification.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>The decision of the organizing team will be final and binding.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rewards &amp; Certificates</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Winners: Winner Certificates</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Participation: Verified Participation Certificates for all participants who successfully complete the quiz.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>",
